DPT EATA adapter driver The driver provides support for third and
fourth  generation  DPT  controllers.  All communication with the
controllers is conducted via the EATA (Enhanced  AT  Bus  Attach‐
ment)  protocol.  DPT adapters examine and interpret all commands
received before passing  them  to  any  underlying  physical  de‐
vice(s).   In  this  way, caching, RAID and other transformations
are achieved while remaining transparent to  the  host  operating
system.   The driver provides support for the adapters listed be‐
low.  Later models are supported by the driver.   control  device
